{{Quote|Transforms the user into a mighty Dragon, allowing them to rule over the skies with scorching flames.|Shop}}
'''Dragon''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Beast]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|15,000,000}} or {{Robux|5,000}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Dragon grants the user dragon-like powers, allowing them to transform into a mythical Dragon. The user can transform into either an Eastern Dragon, resembling those from the East Asian culture, or the Western Dragon, resembling a medieval armored Dragon from European folklore. The user can also transform into a large, tall human-hybrid dragon that deals more massive fiery damage.

Dragon has two versions: one being the '''Western Variant''' and the other being the '''Eastern Variant''', each with different moves mechanic, animations, and appearances while transformed. It also has a Hybrid Form for both versions when a player uses {{Ability|V}} after the Orange Fury Meter (First [[Power Meter|Fury Meter]]) is full and before the Red Fury Meter (Second [[Power Meter|Fury Meter]]) is full.

