==Tip & Tricks==
* {{Ability|X}} is much better in Hybrid Form after the recent buffs and aligns perfectly with a held {{Ability|Godhuman|C}} from [[Godhuman]].
* Using transformed '''[C] Scorching Downfall''' near the ground or in some specific places like Swan's mansion, Diamond tree and other big trees will stuck it making it do more damage and get bigger AoE due to it becoming more close to the move core. 

==Trivia==
* The Dragon Fruit can be obtained from the {{Dragon Egg}} [[Dragon Egg]]s at the [[Prehistoric Island]] or in Gacha, being able to get either the East or West variants.
* Dragon is the most expensive and difficult-to-obtain fruit in the game.
* Before [[Updates/24|Update 24]], Dragon was the third most expensive fruit in the game, with the first being [[Kitsune]] and the second being [[Leopard]] (reworked to [[Tiger]]).
* Before [[Updates/17.3|Update 17.3]], Dragon was once again the most expensive fruit in the game, valued {{Money|3,500,000}}. This is the second time that Dragon is the most valuable fruit.
* Pre-rework, Dragon costed {{Robux|2,600}}, which increased by 92.3% up to {{Robux|5,000}} post-rework, making it by far the highest Robux price increase of any purchasable item in the game.
** Similarly, it also has the highest [[Money]] price increase of any reworked item, going from {{Money|3,500,000}} to {{Money|15,000,000}}, an increase of 328.57%.
* [[Mastery]] gained will be common to both Dragon variations.
* Eastern Dragon has the largest transformed model in the game.
* The transformed Eastern form dragon resembles a creature commonly found in Chinese myths, whereas the Western represents a European folklore Dragon, specifically a {{w|wyvern}}. Additionally, the Eastern Dragon is supposed to be the ruler of seas and bodies of water, unlike its ''Blox Fruits'' counterpart, whose moves are mostly fire-based.
** Dragon's Western version is also similar to a fan-made Wyvern fruit showcased in the 2024 fan art competition.
** Additionally, in most Chinese myths, Eastern Dragons are depicted to have control over the weather, thus allowing them to wield water, thunder, and wind.
* Dragon and [[Kitsune]] are the only beast fruits that, while transformed, can carry players on their backs. However, Dragon needs [[Dragon Tamer|Saddle/Strong Hair]] to carry someone on their back.
* It is also highly recommended to disable screen-shake while using dragon to fight [[bosses]] or for PvP, as it greatly aids the user's aim.
* Dragon and [[Kitsune]] are the only fruits that can be obtained from [[Sea Event]]s such as the [[Kitsune Shrine]] and [[Prehistoric Island]].
* The user can measure how fast they are moving using the Dragon's Hybrid form. The higher the speed, the higher the volume and pitch of the footsteps of the hybrid. 
* Dragon is the first fruit to have two versions on its [[transformation]] and fruit model.
* if the player has [[Aura]] activated during full [[transformation]], they can notice that the dragon gains armor, which is most noticeable on the head. However, this does not give any buffs aside from the normal [[Aura]] buffs.
* Dragon had the highest damage reduction in the game '''(60% Defense)''' until {{Update|30}}, being surpassed by [[Magnet]] '''(62.5% defense).'''
* Using a [[Race Awakening]] transformation while using the hybrid form drains the user's [[Power Meter|Fury Meter]].
* Having the permanent version of Dragon allows the user to choose the version of the fruit used. (Either Western or Eastern.)
* Sometimes, a bug can happen with the Western Dragon where if the user un-transforms, they will not be able to move. In the case of the Eastern Dragon, this bug causes players who untransformed to have a larger hitbox, allowing them to collect items such as fruits and chests much further than supposed and makes users sit in chairs frequently. This can be fixed by resetting the character or transforming into the hybrid form.
* Dragon is often used for [[Leviathan]] hunt because the M1 Hybrid Form can deal great damage. The reason it's better than the [[Magma]] fruit is because its ability is easier to target than moving targets like segment and limits knockback when spamming M1. However, for the head, [[Magma]] is still better.
* Dragon's icon in the [[shop]] is the only icon that goes out of the margin.
* Dragon is the second [[Blox Fruits|fruit]] that has two icons, the other being the old version of [[Control#Trivia|Control]].
* Dragon's untransformed {{Ability|C}} has a similar look to un-awakened [[Light]]'s {{Ability|Light|X}}.
**Dragon's West variant's {{Ability|C}} is actually an eclipse, causing the sun or the moon to disappear momentarily until the move ends.
* The icon on [[inventory]] of the permanent dragon looks merged.
* Dragon is the first fruit in the [[Blox Fruits "Stock"|Stock]] menu to have a unique plaque, being changed in [[Updates/24|Update 24]].
* There is a glitch where discounted Dragon appears on the recommended fruits bar.
* There is a glitch where if the player transforms, they are sometimes "invisible" to other players.
* Dragon was the first fruit to receive the "IN-PROGRESS" status.
* Dragon (East)'s full [[transformation]] emits growling sounds, unlike the Western counterpart.
* Dragon is the only fruit to possess a complete immunity to any sorts of stun, making the [[transformation]] nearly unstoppable, with the only ways to avoid taking damage being by either escaping the moves radius, or using [[Portal]]'s {{Ability|Portal|X}}. However despite having complete immunity, the West variant can still be "Grabbed/Picked" by [[Buddha]]'s {{Ability|Buddha|F|2}} and [[Advanced Combat]]'s '''[X]''' '''Ground Breaker (Charged).'''
* Dragon has the most [[skins]] in the game at ten, with four chromatic skins yet to release.
* If the player uses [[Suspicious Growth Potion]], the size of the dragon (Specifically West) will increase its size twice. (Around Starter Island size)
* Dragon and [[Tiger]] are the only [[Blox Fruits|fruits]] that have two transformations.
* Despite the buff from update 26.8 indicating that max fury will be rewarded from killing a player 50 levels apart, this feature is bugged and killing any player regardless of level will still grant max fury.
* The [X] Move has an extremely hard to see finisher that bursts the target midair, as the finisher requires the enemy to be at less than 12 HP.
* There is a glitch with the Dragon Fruit where if a user transforms into western dragon and lines themselves perfectly with a boat cannon and another player sits on the cannon and the saddle at the same time and the dragon user starts flying the boat will start flying with the dragon user. This glitch is really useful for sea events, and is very commonly used for hunting the Leviathan since the user can just avoid any unnecessary sea events without anyone driving.
* When in Hybrid Form, Dragon's dash sound is the same as [[Yeti]]'s [[Air Jump]]'s while transformed.
* Dragon's VFX has been highly reduced in [[Updates/29.1|Update 29.1]], this was later described as a bug. (Some of the broken VFX can be seem under the map in some locations.)
* Uzoth confirmed during a comparison video between the old and new dragon, the old '''[F]''' move were old roblox assets.<ref>https://youtu.be/D1U5FQk-yIs?si=8m57i9oWWPmkLJRU</ref>
* Ever since this fruit was reworked in Update 24, every fruit reworked or added after it has had M1s.
* The dragon fruit is immune to stuns but for some reason the [[Tiger]] X move knocks back the dragon .

